Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part A}
Comment: 10,0:00:09.57,0:00:10.62,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.20,0:00:14.49,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Want a drink?{[Will you] drink?}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:18.21,0:00:20.63,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Matière-san said you were up here.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.29,0:00:23.21,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,It’s nice. Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.92,0:00:25.21,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.09,0:00:28.47,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I’m okay...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.47,0:00:31.84,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Navi, what kind of Pokémon do you like?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.84,0:00:33.68,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.14,0:00:38.10,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,What do I do?! I can’t pick!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.10,0:00:39.35,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Gotcha...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.35,0:00:40.48,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.48,0:00:43.48,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,How did you two choose \N your first Pokémon?{the chooses are kimeru, as in the ep/movie title I decided upon you (dub: I choose you)}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.32,0:00:49.28,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Um... This little one{She} picked me \N during my school interview! {the picks are erabu, choose/pick/select}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.36,0:00:52.62,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,School, huh...?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.62,0:00:57.79,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,We’d been together for a long time, \N but I just couldn’t choose on my own.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.08,0:01:02.13,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,But then Wanival ended up being \N the one who picked me.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.13,0:01:03.63,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,That little guy{He} picked you?!{Unsure what's best for the "kono ko"s, will think about it. - Toa}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.34,0:01:05.42,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Sure did.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:06.88,0:01:08.38,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,That’s so nice...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.01,0:01:14.97,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi loves Pokémon so much \N that she just can’t pick one...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.97,0:01:16.64,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,I understand the feeling.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:16.64,0:01:22.02,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,So Matière gave it to me, \N for when it’s time to grab hold of my dream...{Dream Ball tagline}{very similar 16:37}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.02,0:01:24.27,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Your Dream Ball, you mean...?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.81,0:01:25.52,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.57,0:01:28.15,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,That’s why it was {precious}important...
Comment: 0,0:01:51.63,0:01:51.63,Main,,0,0,0,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:03:21.72,0:03:21.72,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part B}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.03,0:03:37.78,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,It’s morning, Navi.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.87,0:03:44.12,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,I’m heading out on morning patrol.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.04,0:03:47.33,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I’ll skip it today...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.33,0:03:49.17,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Everyone else said \N they’re coming along.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.17,0:03:49.88,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hmph...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.92,0:03:56.51,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Come retrace the route we searched \N for Melecie yesterday. Maybe we could find it.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.97,0:03:58.05,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I’m coming!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.05,0:04:00.18,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,First, I gotta get \N the coffee ready, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.85,0:04:01.76,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,That’s right!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.18,0:04:03.76,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Everyone, good morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.35,0:04:05.73,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Good morning, Navi!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.73,0:04:07.10,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.10,0:04:08.14,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.73,0:04:10.27,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Sleep well?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.40,0:04:16.90,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Everyone, get ready for a patrol!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.90,0:04:18.78,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Yeawww...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.78,0:04:21.45,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Ult... Don’t respond with a yawn.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.45,0:04:22.87,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,You really are a little kid!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.87,0:04:24.04,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Wuzzat?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.74,0:05:04.08,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,This is the area where we \N chased after Melecie yesterday, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.45,0:05:05.54,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.45,0:05:09.46,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Maybe this isn’t where I lost it...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.92,0:05:20.97,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys... \N What’s the matter?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.56,0:05:28.47,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,I see. Of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.47,0:05:31.35,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Dot, I have a request for Wanival.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.35,0:05:33.69,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.69,0:05:35.82,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Could you wash away this sludge?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.44,0:05:37.86,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.86,0:05:40.32,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Wanival! Aqua Cutter!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.62,0:05:49.58,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Wanival’s so cool!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.96,0:05:55.17,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,They were having trouble \N getting through...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.17,0:05:57.25,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,How did you know that?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.25,0:05:59.34,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Fluff{mokoo} told her!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.51,0:06:04.09,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,You two are always \N on the same page, eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.09,0:06:07.72,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Yeah! Fluff’s always helping me out!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.06,0:06:15.81,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,What’s wrong, Subomie?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.11,0:06:21.94,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,A Shishiko! \N The Subomie are in danger!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.94,0:06:24.07,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,We’ve gotta save ‘em! Cap!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.07,0:06:26.07,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Let’s go, Yamirami!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.30,0:06:42.30,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Isn’t that great, Subomie?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.30,0:06:46.01,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Thank you, \N Cap and Yamirami.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.81,0:06:52.81,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.81,0:06:56.31,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,There really are wild Pokémon \N in all sorts of places...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.31,0:07:01.28,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Yeah. I think Pokémon \N must love this city, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.86,0:07:03.49,Main,Person,0,0,0,,What a mess...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.49,0:07:05.28,Main,Person,0,0,0,,It’s still not fixed?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.28,0:07:07.07,Main,Old lady,0,0,0,,Ms. Detective! \N Do you have a moment?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.07,0:07:08.95,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Sure, what is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.95,0:07:11.66,Main,Old lady,0,0,0,,My apartment building \N had a blackout...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.66,0:07:12.83,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.29,0:07:15.33,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Denryu!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.58,0:07:20.80,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,She says this apartment building \N has had a blackout.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.21,0:07:24.72,Main,Old lady,0,0,0,,If you would, Denryu-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.09,0:07:29.22,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Here we go, Denryu.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.22,0:07:33.31,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Shine down the light \N of the great sun!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.19,0:07:42.82,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Mega Evolve!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.24,0:07:54.45,Main,Old lady,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.45,0:07:56.71,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Thank you, Denryu!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.71,0:07:58.58,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Fixing a blackout with Mega Evolution...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.58,0:08:01.38,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,There she goes again, \N always wastin’ Mega Evolution...{113 (mudadzukai)}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.38,0:08:05.38,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,It’s not a waste! \N It’s to help people. Right, Denryu?{mudadzukai}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.93,0:08:10.64,Main,Old lady,0,0,0,,Thank you, \N Ms. Detective and Denryu-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.64,0:08:12.26,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,You’re welcome.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.26,0:08:15.98,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,It’s like Matière-san is \N the city’s handywoman.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.98,0:08:19.44,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Yeah. Being a detective \N seems like a wonderful job.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.44,0:08:23.61,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,She spends every day just like this, \N keeping the peace in Miare City.{142}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.61,0:08:25.65,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,So? Awesome, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.65,0:08:28.49,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,And why are {\i1}you{\i0} bragging?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.79,0:09:17.20,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Smells great!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.20,0:09:19.33,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi’s hungry!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.33,0:09:21.67,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Think it’s time \N we take a little break?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.92,0:09:26.88,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Mmm, mega-tasty!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.59,0:09:35.26,Main,Food stand guy,0,0,0,,Here you go! \N Your special coffee milk, miss!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.26,0:09:36.60,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.23,0:09:42.73,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ahh! It really is best fresh!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.73,0:09:44.69,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,That’s the special coffee milk?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.69,0:09:46.73,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yeah! Oh! Right, right!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.73,0:09:51.95,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,This plaza’s where Matière \N first told me about coffee milk!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.95,0:09:56.45,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,You’re right. \N Wasn’t this the place where we first met?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.87,0:10:01.71,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Matière and Fluff{mokoo} seemed like they were having \N so much fun, so I decided to stay with them!{not the decide of other lines, more ambiguous 'so I made it so' that I stayed with them}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.71,0:10:03.04,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.04,0:10:07.80,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yeah! Navi’s been playing with \N the Pokémon in Miare City so long,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.80,0:10:10.63,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,she doesn’t remember \N what she did before that!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.63,0:10:13.63,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Which is why I asked Navi \N to become my assistant.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.63,0:10:15.47,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,And I was like, “Leave it to me!”
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.35,0:10:19.77,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Aww...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.77,0:10:23.14,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Where could my Dream Ball \N have gotten to...?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.49,0:10:36.62,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Look out, Navi!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.62,0:10:37.41,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Comment: 10,0:10:38.91,0:10:40.49,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.16,0:10:43.71,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Navi, are you okay?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.71,0:10:44.62,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Metamon?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.62,0:10:45.88,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Why is it here?!
Comment: 10,0:10:45.88,0:10:47.88,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ow-ow-ow... Ahh!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.88,0:10:50.92,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I met you before! On the ship!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.05,0:10:57.22,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.93,0:11:00.26,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.89,0:11:03.93,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi’s Dream Ball!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.93,0:11:05.52,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.69,0:11:09.36,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I mean it... Thank you...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.98,0:11:14.32,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Metamon had the Dream Ball?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.32,0:11:17.99,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Of course! So you dropped it \N on the Brave Asagi yesterday!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.99,0:11:19.87,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Isn’t that great, Navi?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.87,0:11:20.83,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.41,0:11:24.66,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon, you okay?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.75,0:11:28.00,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,It looks like it’s hungry!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.38,0:11:33.01,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Want a drink too?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.38,0:11:39.39,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,You like it? Navi loves it, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.14,0:11:48.15,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,They look like they’re having fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.15,0:11:51.57,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,They’re good friends with Metamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.40,0:11:54.19,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,It transformed into her tail!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.32,0:11:57.40,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,That’s Metamon’s signature move.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.36,0:11:59.28,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I get it!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.28,0:12:05.54,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,{\q2}Turning into Trimmien’s hat, and Masquernya’s tail... \N It plays by transforming into all sortsa stuff, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.42,0:12:10.29,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,That’s so nice...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.88,0:12:19.34,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.27,0:12:36.86,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Now, back to patrolling!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.86,0:12:38.57,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi’ll give you the tour!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.11,0:12:40.86,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,This place’s my home turf.{142}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.86,0:12:43.12,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I know more than {\i1}you{\i0} ever could.{I know more [about it] than the likes of you.}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.12,0:12:44.54,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Right, Yamirami?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.49,0:12:48.00,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi’s not gonna be beat!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.00,0:12:49.50,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Let’s go, Metamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.76,0:13:02.14,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Navi! It’s about time we head back!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.14,0:13:03.51,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.44,0:13:13.65,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,You can turn into anything... \N I’m so jealous.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.48,0:13:20.11,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon, you go adventuring \N with Cap and everyone, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.24,0:13:22.70,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,That’s so nice...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.70,0:13:27.66,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,{\q2}Navi wants to go visit all sortsa places, \N and see all sortsa Pokémon she’s never seen before, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.16,0:13:32.71,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi’d probably find it, then...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.71,0:13:36.71,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,What Navi wants to do... \N Navi’s dream... Yeah, for sure!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.77,0:13:52.52,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Ahh, I’m beat...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.52,0:13:55.48,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Thank you. \N You really helped us out there.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.48,0:13:56.77,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Right, Fluff{mokoo}?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.48,0:14:00.49,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Thank you, too. \N It was a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.49,0:14:05.12,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,I learned a ton. About the wild Pokémon \N living in the city, and other stuff too!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.12,0:14:07.95,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,And we found the Dream Ball as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.95,0:14:10.25,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Thanks for looking for it with me!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.50,0:14:19.00,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait! \N The Brave Asagi’s finished resupplying!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.00,0:14:21.01,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Guess it’s about time you get going.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.01,0:14:23.09,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Yeah. See ya ‘round, Matière.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.09,0:14:25.05,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Thank you for all your help.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.05,0:14:28.14,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Matière-san, \N your cooking was delicious.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.14,0:14:31.31,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Glad to hear it. \N Feel free to visit again anytime.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.27,0:14:38.65,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Everyone, take care!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.32,0:14:41.15,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon, thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.49,0:14:46.45,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,We’ll see you, then!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.45,0:14:47.99,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.99,0:14:49.99,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.66,0:14:54.33,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Comment: 0,0:15:04.47,0:15:04.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part C}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.06,0:15:16.56,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.56,0:15:17.81,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,We’re home!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.81,0:15:19.65,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Have fun in Miare?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.65,0:15:21.82,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was a lovely place!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.82,0:15:23.78,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,There were loads of Pokémon, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.78,0:15:25.99,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,How did it feel being back \N in your hometown?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.99,0:15:28.78,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,It was a’ight! \N Same as it ever was, anyhow!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.32,0:15:31.16,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,We’re all prepped \N and ready to go, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.49,0:15:33.41,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Well then, let’s set off!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.41,0:15:35.16,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.16,0:15:37.62,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Let’s go, Cap!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.64,0:15:51.10,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Ah, so you {\i1}were{\i0} up here.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.31,0:15:55.31,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,You’ve found it then, eh, Navi?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.31,0:15:56.10,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.10,0:15:57.31,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.31,0:15:58.77,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Your dream.{Navi's dream.}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.19,0:16:01.32,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi’s... dream?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.32,0:16:06.07,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Yeah. Fluff{mokoo} let me know how you feel.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.07,0:16:07.28,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Fluff{mokoo} did...?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.58,0:16:16.00,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,To tell the truth... \N I realized that I’d been pampering you.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.00,0:16:17.54,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Matière?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.54,0:16:22.92,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,When we’re together, \N I end up babying you more than I do anyone else.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.92,0:16:25.46,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Why... are you saying that now?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.96,0:16:27.93,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Because now’s my only chance to.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.93,0:16:32.35,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,{\q2}Ever since you first spotted that airship up here, \N you haven’t stopped shining.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.35,0:16:33.89,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Shining?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.51,0:16:37.10,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,And... someone found it for you, right?{[Metamon] found [your dream] for you, didn't [Metamon]?}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.10,0:16:41.61,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,“When the time comes to grab hold of your dream...” \N That time is {\i1}now,{\i0} wouldn’t you say? {Dream Ball tagline}{very similar 01:16}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.52,0:16:45.94,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,I {\i1}did{\i0} feel it was a bit early for you,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.94,0:16:49.61,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,but I want to put your feelings first.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.61,0:16:52.87,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,What you want to see... \N What you want to do...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.87,0:16:58.37,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,The Pokémon you want to be with when you leave... \N Because I knew you {\i1}would{\i0} leave someday.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.37,0:17:00.87,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,That’s... now...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.29,0:17:06.00,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,You’ve gotta grab hold of it \N with your Dream Ball!{Dream Ball tagline}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.51,0:17:09.01,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I’ll be right back!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.51,0:17:13.72,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.01,0:17:18.64,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.65,0:17:23.48,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,What a lovely city it was.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.48,0:17:24.65,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,You know it!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.65,0:17:27.15,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Miare’s the strongest!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.46,0:17:43.67,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.09,0:17:49.59,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.24,0:18:12.36,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Kairyu?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.24,0:18:18.74,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.74,0:18:21.25,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,You came back for me... Metamon...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.00,0:18:27.09,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi wants to go with you!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.09,0:18:29.59,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,With Metamon and everyone else!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.93,0:18:39.64,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.85,0:18:46.15,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Navi.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.15,0:18:47.11,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.52,0:18:50.48,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,We don’t always pick our Pokémon.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.48,0:18:52.65,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Pokémon can pick us, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.65,0:18:54.86,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I bet you’ll be just fine, Navi!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.49,0:19:01.95,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi thinks you’re amazing, Metamon! \N You can be all sorts of things!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.95,0:19:03.96,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi wants to do \N all sorts of things, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.96,0:19:06.67,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,And with you, \N Metamon, I think I can!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.50,0:19:08.59,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:09.63,0:19:11.05,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,So, will you...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.64,0:19:18.39,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,...stay with me?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.60,0:19:28.81,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.20,0:19:41.41,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Thank you for finding me.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.33,0:19:44.04,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.92,0:19:52.59,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Let’s be friends, Metamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.09,0:19:56.72,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Congrats, Navi and Metamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.72,0:19:58.64,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.27,0:20:10.73,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I have a request for \N all you Rising Voltteccers!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.24,0:20:19.99,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi wants to go on adventures \N with Metamon on the Brave Asagi!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.16,0:20:24.29,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.29,0:20:25.66,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.08,0:20:29.42,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.42,0:20:32.04,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,It looks great on you, \N and on Metamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.67,0:20:35.84,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Thank you, Matière!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.84,0:20:37.67,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,And take this, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.38,0:20:41.09,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi’s own Smartphone Rotom!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.47,0:20:44.06,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Now, you’re all set for travel!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.06,0:20:45.31,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.94,0:20:52.73,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Good morning, \N Navi and Matière-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.73,0:20:53.82,Main,Navi Matière,0,0,0,,Good morning!{Not 100% sure who's saying this}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.82,0:20:56.78,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Ooh, that’s a lovely outfit! \N It looks great on you!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.78,0:20:59.03,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yeah! Navi loves it, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.78,0:21:01.91,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Whoa! You were in there, Metamon?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.91,0:21:04.08,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yup! It’s great, right?!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.45,0:21:08.96,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Well then, Navi... \N Greet the Captain of the Brave Asagi!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.50,0:21:11.29,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Pleased to be traveling with you!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.04,0:21:14.38,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Counting on you!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.38,0:21:16.13,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,A new friend, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.13,0:21:17.42,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Great to have you!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:18.13,0:21:21.18,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Everyone, \N please take good care of Navi.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.18,0:21:23.55,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,We’ll all make sure to \N look after her.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.01,0:21:26.39,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Ult, you look after Navi too, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.77,0:21:29.31,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:34.90,0:21:36.27,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I’m heading out!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:36.82,0:21:38.65,Main,Matière,0,0,0,,Have a nice trip!
Comment: 0,0:21:45.53,0:21:45.53,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie A}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.58,0:21:48.20,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Friede here!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.20,0:21:52.00,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,It’s time to Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.04,0:21:55.50,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Today’s topic is Trimmien!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.50,0:21:58.63,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,People cut its fur \N and go wild over its various styles,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:58.63,0:22:01.55,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,but do you know \N which of these styles actually exists?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.39,0:22:06.51,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,See the answer after the commercials!
Comment: 0,0:22:06.51,0:22:06.51,Main,,0,0,0,,{Ending}
Comment: 0,0:23:36.52,0:23:36.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie B}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:40.44,0:23:42.44,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Time to announce \N the correct answer!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:42.44,0:23:43.90,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,The answer is...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:43.90,0:23:45.90,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,B: Heart Cut!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:45.90,0:23:50.41,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Cutting its fur doesn’t just give it \N sharper fashion sense, but sharper reflexes, too!{When cut, not just its appearance, but also its body gains more kire(stylishness/agility)! ah puns.}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:51.95,0:23:54.29,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,You want to try this style?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:58.12,0:24:00.54,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,S-So cute!
Comment: 0,0:24:00.54,0:24:00.54,Main,,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:01.92,0:24:05.09,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi became one of \N the Rising Voltteccers!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:05.84,0:24:09.30,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,The Brave Asagi’s amazing! \N It’s got {\i1}everything!{\i}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:09.30,0:24:11.39,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Ugh, a little kid gettin’ all riled up...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:11.39,0:24:13.39,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,What’s with you, {\i1}little kid{\i0} Ult?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:13.39,0:24:15.93,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Huh?! I’m your {\i1}senpai,{\i0} y’know!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:17.44,0:24:20.56,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Navi, Ult... Can I ask you two \N to run an errand?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:20.56,0:24:21.23,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:21.23,0:24:22.77,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Why me?!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:22.77,0:24:26.03,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,And so, to be continued \N next time on Pocket Monsters!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:26.03,0:24:28.49,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi’s Little Big Adventure!
